# MNN-Pocket-0.3B-GGUF

GGUF export of [MNN-Pocket-0.3B](https://huggingface.co/taobao-mnn/MNN-Pocket-0.3B) for llama.cpp and compatible runtimes (LM Studio, ollama, ...).

MNN-Pocket is a family of compact (~300M parameter) language models co-designed with the [MNN](https://github.com/alibaba/MNN) inference stack for on-device deployment, targeting phones, tablets, laptops and smart glasses.

- **Three quants to trade quality against footprint**: F16 (726 MB), Q8_0 (387 MB), Q4_1 (192 MB)
- **Q4_1 is quantization-aware trained**, so the 4-bit file keeps near-BF16 accuracy (49.59 vs 50.00 average on the 11-benchmark suite)
- **32K context** and ChatML-style chat template embedded in the GGUF metadata
- Best for on-device assistants, data extraction and lightweight agentic pipelines; like other sub-billion models it is not recommended for reasoning-heavy workloads (advanced math, long-horizon code)

Find more details in the original model card: https://huggingface.co/taobao-mnn/MNN-Pocket-0.3B

